3. Improved the mocking structure to be more robust
4. Added proper TypeScript types
5. Included loading and error states
6. Used try-catch block to handle import errors
7. Simplified the mocking approach to avoid jest.mock() which might not work in this context

The changes should help resolve the module fetching error by:
